# Rip, Spawn Hunter: "different powers" counts a Vehicle's power as it counts a creature's (CR 208.1). Of the four cards revealed on turn 3,
# Hill Giant and Smuggler's Copter both have power 3, so Bot1 cannot take both; the Island is neither a creature nor a Vehicle card and
# cannot be taken. Bot1 takes the Copter and Ornithopter (power 0, a power like any other), and the Hill Giant and Island go to the bottom.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Rip, Spawn Hunter
Island
Island
Island
Hill Giant
Smuggler's Copter
Island
Ornithopter
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rip, Spawn Hunter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Rip, Spawn Hunter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot1.Choose(Island)
! Bot1.Choose(Hill Giant; Smuggler's Copter)
Bot1.Choose(Smuggler's Copter; Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter; Smuggler's Copter
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
